    "message": "fix: re-pin the historical source ledger after the #125 squash merge (#139)\n\nHISTORICAL_SOURCE_LEDGER.json pins each restored path to its most recent\npath commit. #125 was squash-merged, so the pins for install.sh and\ninstaller/install.sh still named the pre-squash branch commit 79cd989,\nwhich is not on main, and structural-pre-acceptance reports the ledger as\nstale. Regenerated with `python3 tools/build_historical_source_ledger.py\n--write`; only those two commit fields change.\n\nCo-authored-by: rappter1 <rappter1@icloud.com>\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\nCopilot-Session: 3c809e9a-e035-48bc-a028-c6b6de624fbb",
