    "message": "fix: correct generated ecosystem ancestor identity and link (#123)\n\n* fix(ecosystem): correct ancestor without refreshing historical inventory\n\nUse the canonical Prototype repository slug for the ancestor category, ID, and HTTPS link. Add offline ancestor-only generation and check modes so the distinct dated JSON and HTML inventories retain their other nodes, metadata, privacy flags, and historical references.\n\nCloses #104\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* chore(docs): refresh receipts for the corrected ancestor snapshot\n\nRecord the regenerated ecosystem HTML bytes and their source commit, then recompute the exact tracked-byte inventory. Preserve the historical source capsule, path inventory, and authority records.\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: rappter1 <rappter1@icloud.com>\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\nCopilot-Session: 3c809e9a-e035-48bc-a028-c6b6de624fbb",
