    "message": "docs: retire repository-derived identities in archived onboarding (#122)\n\nRemove the owner/repo hash recipe and adjacent Eternity and on-read identity claims without rewriting the surrounding history. Direct readers to pinned RAPP/1 section 6 and the current onboarding/status boundary instead of maintaining another mint implementation.\n\nAdd regression coverage for the removed recipe, nearby authority links, and preserved archive markers. Refresh the tracked-byte receipt using the existing documentation checker measurement.\n\nCloses #102\n\nCo-authored-by: rappter1 <rappter1@icloud.com>\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\nCopilot-Session: 3c809e9a-e035-48bc-a028-c6b6de624fbb",
